Read only the signals of the voxels of the spheres, in chunks of ``markers.spheres.chunksize`` volumes (default 100), in :class:`.JuniferNiftiSpheresMasker`, instead of loading the whole 4D data, reducing the memory used by the sphere-based markers (e.g., :class:`.SphereAggregation` and :class:`.FunctionalConnectivitySpheres`) on BOLD data, with the same results, and do not change the input data when it has NaN values by `Fede Raimondo`_